Zero-dependency MCP stdio server (category: {{.Category}}, runtime: python).

## Layout

- `manifest.json` — catalog metadata (name, entry, runtime); ships in the Tool Store
- `{{.Entry}}` — the server; replace the example tool with yours
- `test/smoke.py` — handshake + tools/list + tools/call check

## Develop

```
python3 test/smoke.py
```

Dependencies (only if unavoidable) go in `requirements.txt` — the installer
runs `pip install --target vendor -r requirements.txt`; prefer stdlib-only.

## Ship

Commit this folder under `mcp/{{.Name}}/` and cut a release tag — the
dynamic catalog picks it up for every existing install within ~15 minutes,
no gateway upgrade needed.
